      "data": {
        "text": "**Considering External Providers**\n\nI'm currently focused on selecting a concrete external provider for expense normalization. My thoughts lean toward cloud-based OCR or document processing services. Identifying this external service clearly within the code is a high priority.\n\n\n**Defining Implementation Steps**\n\nI've outlined concrete steps for developing `normalize_expense.py` using Google Cloud Document AI. The code will use the client library to process receipts with a pre-trained expense processor, printing the normalized entities. I'll include placeholders for project-specific information and ensure the Document AI client library is imported to clearly identify the provider within the code.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789865795632,
          "start": 1789865790476
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc508c0c001RBgSWQNWqavZTY",
